WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:12.746 --> 00:00:17.283
Believe it or not, you're in the
 middle of the Kalahari Desert

00:00:18.385 --> 00:00:21.688
in a place that is home to
 some of the most diverse

00:00:21.688 --> 00:00:25.125
wildlife on the planet. 

00:00:26.760 --> 00:00:28.995
Here, you can move among them.

00:00:33.199 --> 00:00:41.608
They watch you. 

00:00:41.608 --> 00:00:49.482
They listen to you. 

00:00:50.650 --> 00:00:57.357
And they can smell you.

00:00:59.092 --> 00:01:03.096
Welcome to the Okavango Delta.

00:01:07.967 --> 00:01:09.602
This incredible wildlife 

00:01:09.602 --> 00:01:12.405
coexists within a
 balanced ecosystem.

00:01:14.074 --> 00:01:17.110
Protecting it has created
 a conservation-based

00:01:17.110 --> 00:01:20.880
tourism economy for Botswana. 

00:01:22.449 --> 00:01:26.453
But this oasis is supplied
 by water that comes from Angola

00:01:26.853 --> 00:01:29.355
through a wider system
 that's under threat.

00:01:30.490 --> 00:01:33.393
Climate change, deforestation

00:01:33.860 --> 00:01:37.597
and commercial agriculture
 upstream are putting it at risk

00:01:38.631 --> 00:01:42.302
National Geographic and De Beers
 are working together

00:01:42.302 --> 00:01:44.637
in a partnership with local 
communities

00:01:44.971 --> 00:01:46.339
to help protect it.

00:01:48.007 --> 00:01:50.110
Developing livelihood 
 opportunities

00:01:50.110 --> 00:01:53.780
so local communities
 earn more income from 
ecotourism

00:01:54.180 --> 00:01:56.583
and raising awareness
 of this unique wonder

00:01:56.816 --> 00:01:58.751
so it can be protected forever.

00:02:00.820 --> 00:02:02.889
By visiting the Okavango Delta

00:02:02.889 --> 00:02:06.559
and supporting the people here,
 you can help too.

00:02:07.594 --> 00:02:11.331
Hire an expert local guide
 to walk amongst elephants

00:02:11.564 --> 00:02:15.335
and learn more about
 how they shape the landscape.

00:02:27.914 --> 00:02:31.584
Book the Mokoro Safari
 through a locally run operator

00:02:31.985 --> 00:02:35.355
to experience the Delta
 in a traditional boat, led

00:02:35.355 --> 00:02:38.191
by an expert poler. 

00:02:41.327 --> 00:02:45.698
Or to fully immerse yourself,
 book a night under the stars

00:02:45.698 --> 00:02:51.104
with the communities
of the Delta.

00:03:02.649 --> 00:03:07.921
It will surely be an experience
you will never forget.

00:03:13.326 --> 00:03:17.130
Together, we can help ensure
 that this lush paradise,

00:03:17.463 --> 00:03:18.565
along with the people 

00:03:18.565 --> 00:03:22.835
and wildlife who live here, can
 thrive for generations to come.

